  "sourceTitle": "Plain Cookies",
  "sourceText": "Plain Cookies\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 13, 2009 - 12:32am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 sticks butter\n1 cup sugar\n1 egg\n1 teaspoon vanilla\n2 1/2 cups self rising flour\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix altogether. Make into a roll. Wrap in wax paper. Let cool and firm in refrigerator. Slice and bake at 350 degrees until brown. Make a bunch and freeze.\n\nComments:\nAnonymous\n\ni wont to know how to make them i no what thay look like...\nAnonymous\n\nlove CM",
